(2, 'Rahul Verma', '/assets/reviews/rahul.jpg', 'Great variety and amazing taste. The Chicken Tikka Burger is absolutely delicious. Highly recommended!', 5, NOW()),
(3, 'Anjali Patel', '/assets/reviews/anjali.jpg', 'Love the veggie options! The Paneer Burger is so flavorful. Perfect for vegetarians.', 4, NOW()),
(4, 'Vikram Singh', '/assets/reviews/vikram.jpg', 'Amazing combos and great value for money. The Family Combo is perfect for weekend gatherings.', 5, NOW());
